# The recipe map layout of each kind of simple machine and generator screen: its map, the item slots and tanks it
# shows on each side and how far its slots are moved down, then each slot, tank, progress bar and image. Recorded
# from the screens of the old GUI system before they moved to ModularUI 2; RecipeMachineLayoutTest compares the
# layouts of every registered machine with it exactly, and writes the layouts it found under build/layouts.
